Northstar is developed collaboratively by humans and AI.

# Northstar @VERSION@

This package contains the XMPP server, browser client, administration interface,
Swagger UI and configuration examples.

Start with the included [installation guide](docs/INSTALL.md) for checksum
verification, PostgreSQL setup, configuration and migrations. Run the server
from the extracted directory so it can find its Web assets and configuration.
Check the version with `./xmpp-server --version` on Linux or
`.\xmpp-server.exe --version` in Windows PowerShell.

PostgreSQL 15 or newer is required. Linux x64 is the supported production target;
Windows x64 is for development and evaluation.

