- [HTTP API specification](https://github.com/takanashi-tetsuya/northstar/blob/v@VERSION@/docs/openapi.yaml)

Docker deployments and source builds use the
[v@VERSION@ repository checkout](https://github.com/takanashi-tetsuya/northstar/tree/v@VERSION@).
See the installation guide for the Docker checkout command.

